    "I'm sorry to hear that.": ["My grandma is in the hospital.","Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. I hope she feels better soon.","Naa sa ospital ang akong lola. / Ay, nasubo ko sa akong nadungog. Hinaot nga maayo na siya sa dili madugay."],
    "It's not a big deal.": ["I'm so sorry I spilled your coffee!","It's not a big deal. Don't worry about it.","Pasayloa gyud ko, nayabo nako ang imong kape! / Gamay ra nga butang. Ayaw na kabalaka."],
    "I love your shoes.": ["I love your shoes! Where did you get them?","Thanks! I got them in Cebu.","Nindot kaayo imong sapatos! Asa nimo napalit? / Salamat! Sa Cebu nako napalit."],
    "Do you want to grab coffee sometime?": ["Do you want to grab coffee sometime?","Sure, I'd love to!","Mangape ta usa ka adlaw? / Sige, ganahan kaayo ko!"],
