    "I'll get back to you.": ["Can you join the meeting on Thursday?","Let me check my schedule, and I'll get back to you.","Makaapil ka sa miting sa Huwebes? / Tan-awon usa nako ang akong iskedyul, unya tubagon tika."],
    "I'm running late.": ["Where are you? The meeting starts in five minutes.","Sorry, I'm running late. I'll be there in ten.","Asa na ka? Lima na lang ka minuto, magsugod na ang miting. / Pasayloa, malangan ko og gamay. Moabot ko sulod sa napulo ka minuto."],
    "Can we push the meeting to 3?": ["Can we push the meeting to 3? Something came up.","Sure, 3 works for me.","Puwede nato ibalhin ang miting sa alas tres? Naa koy kalit nga asikasohon. / Sige, okay ra nako ang alas tres."],
